            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'># of Orders Lower Threshold:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'> Delivery fee amounts with less than N orders with the relevant delivery type will be bucketed into &quot;Other&quot;.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'>% of Orders Lower Threshold:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'> Delivery fee amounts with lower than N% of sub entity orders with the relevant delivery type will be bucketed into &quot;Other&quot;.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'>DF Upper Threshold:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'> Delivery fee amounts (local currency) higher than N will be bucketed into &quot;Other&quot;.</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'>DF Type:</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'> Free, Main, or Other. (</run>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'>Main</run>
              <run fontalignment='1' fontsize='8'>: Delivery fee amounts with significant share/number of orders, excluding free deliveries.)</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
